# Product and Technical Decisions

Status: IN_PROGRESS
Milestone: M0 Planning foundation
Dependencies: None

## Purpose

Resolve decisions that would otherwise cause expensive implementation churn.

## Accepted

- [x] Unity is the production engine.
- [x] Gameplay uses true 3D geometry and collision.
- [x] Presentation targets original low-poly/retro-modern styling.
- [x] First vertical slice is offline.
- [x] First territory implementation is floor-only.
- [x] Prototype remains a separate historical mechanics reference.

## Blocking decisions

- [x] Confirm Unity editor version for project creation: `2022.3.47f1`.
- [x] Confirm URP `14.0.11` as the rendering pipeline.
- [ ] Confirm first-slice team count: proposed Ice versus Fire.
- [ ] Confirm first pressure system.
- [ ] Confirm territory authority experiment and decision gate.
- [ ] Confirm target PC minimum for performance validation.
- [ ] Confirm keyboard/mouse and gamepad as required devices.
- [ ] Confirm elimination versus non-lethal disruption.
- [ ] Confirm bank behavior for the slice.
- [ ] Confirm initial match duration target.
- [ ] Confirm working title remains EntropyTag.

